{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>38歲「性感女神」崔碧珈（Anita）早前斬斷與Rocky的「父女戀」，並與神秘猛男同遊意大利。近日她似乎已經徹底走出陰霾，繼摩納哥惹火慶生後，再度於社交平台大派福利，分享於意大利古堡的火辣靚相，好身材震撼網民眼球。</p><figure><img alt=\"崔碧珈身穿超低胸裙。（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155838974124888064870296.jpeg/4IXB2yF_WscfCdfaOGgzftZXFWUnUHX_4vmnn-L5p58\"/><figcaption>崔碧珈身穿超低胸裙。（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><p>低胸裙狂騷惹火好身材</p><p>崔碧珈一向以身材惹火見稱，早前經歷感情風波後積極裝備自己，狀態大勇。相中可見，崔碧珈身穿一條超低胸的吊帶連身裙，盡顯玲瓏浮凸的S型曲線。在烈日當空下依然笑容滿面，深V戰衣將其豐滿上圍展露無遺。</p><figure><img alt=\"大騷S型曲線。（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155838971918553088594107.jpeg/vyZsDaXm1pTH1AFey2xuZavtqrsjT-SZ6tQLTerUC00\"/><figcaption>大騷S型曲線。（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sexy！（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155838969649303552064821.jpeg/elEhPW-CHyMKi8VrDJcOPOnPXYzLA-Vr9UKkpPVCpKQ\"/><figcaption>Sexy！（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><p>預告汽車節戰衣更性感</p><p>今次古堡之行，其實是為了9月底舉行的汽車節做準備。崔碧珈更向粉絲賣關子，霸氣留言：「I’m already getting my outfit ready for the gala! Who else is planning to attend?」預告屆時的戰衣將會更加性感，引來大批網民點讚，紛紛留言大呼期待。</p><figure><img alt=\"崔碧珈慶祝38歲生日。（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148593090064289792750196.jpeg/ywsbO0uc015oaBMdhq95uzaRtzb88Z3WIoqX1SKKl9U\"/><figcaption>崔碧珈慶祝38歲生日。（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與神秘男同遊意大利。（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155839701232390144095418.jpeg/r3N9ibdaiC_qs7w3TmY5wlP3UeY2iLJp_J_yb_yf8m8\"/><figcaption>與神秘男同遊意大利。（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260720/1155839803279806464738210.jpeg/AcsovhmjnJ8lVix1De604PQaJOobO_dLCM4F_QjOBf0\"/><figcaption>（IG@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不時派福利！（IG/@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250215/967470426135465984024596.jpeg/QmpSWn3ns0igNAKhaC0PY4_NgsUfsQtijuHIDo7hyA4\"/><figcaption>不時派福利！（IG/@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年生活富貴！（IG/@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251213/1076508596226887680479056.jpeg/S3VuCiTT-JEVJuAQRz8yZW4xp3G0f8Mdi4OZf4uDmX8\"/><figcaption>近年生活富貴！（IG/@anitachui）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年生活富貴！（IG/@anitachui）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251213/1076508600815718400571802.jpeg/DqjJ6n2c5wXN1lmlBlVc2eG999Zq5l3wShgF00oYBdM\"/><figcaption>近年生活富貴！（IG/@anitachui）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T11:39:00.115870+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":585,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}